/node_modules/
/data/
/dist/
# Claude Design canvas working files: a 69 KB vendored runtime plus generated
# mockups. The reference is the implemented page, not these.
/design/
.env
*.log

# The global excludes file (~/.gitignore_global) drops AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md
# from every repository. They belong in this one -- project memory is meant to
# be committed -- and a repo-level rule outranks the global one. Without these
# two lines a fresh clone has no documentation at all, and nothing warns you.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
